 class=\"schema-faq-question\">4. <strong>Is Bing better than Google?<\/strong><\/strong> <p class=\"schema-faq-answer\">Bing is not better overall, but it can be useful for image search, desktop users, and Microsoft integrations.<\/p> <\/div> <div class=\"schema-faq-section\" id=\"faq-question-1777547452127\"><strong class=\"schema-faq-question\">5. <strong>Which search engine is best in China?<\/strong><\/strong> <p class=\"schema-faq-answer\">Baidu is the most widely used and effective search engine in China.<\/p> <\/div> <div class=\"schema-faq-section\" id=\"faq-question-1777547465222\"><strong class=\"schema-faq-question\">6. <strong>How many search engines exist in the world?<\/strong><\/strong> <p class=\"schema-faq-answer\">There are dozens of search engines, but only a handful are widely used globally.<\/p> <\/div> <div class=\"schema-faq-section\" id=\"faq-question-1777547498124\"><strong class=\"schema-faq-question\">7. <strong>Can a website rank on multiple search engines?<\/strong><\/strong> <p class=\"schema-faq-answer\">Yes. Websites can rank on multiple search engines, though ranking factors may differ slightly.<\/p> <\/div> <div class=\"schema-faq-section\" id=\"faq-question-1777547526671\"><strong class=\"schema-faq-question\">8. <strong>Which search engine is best for students?<\/strong><\/strong> <p class=\"schema-faq-answer\">Google is generally best due to its accuracy and access to educational resources.<\/p> <\/div> <\/div>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-white-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-background-color has-text-color has-background has-link-color wp-elements-e1fc883f2a064c2ee23f1a20caaaed0f\"><strong>Explore Our Free Courses<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table\"><table class=\"has-fixed-layout\"><tbody><tr><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/resources\/semrush\/free-course\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Free Semrush Course<\/a><\/td><td class=\"has-text-al